  "body": "Proudly offered to the market for the first time since new, this well-designed family home delivers modern living, effortless entertaining and an enviable Gulf Harbour lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a warm and inviting space that flows effortlessly to the covered balcony.\r\n\r\nDesigned with style, comfort and practicality in mind, the home was built using quality, durable materials, including weatherboard cladding, aluminium joinery and asphalt shingle roofing.\r\n\r\nWhat’s on offer:\r\n\r\n• 4 generous bedrooms\r\n• 2 bathrooms, including a private ensuite\r\n• Well-appointed modern kitchen\r\n• Rear deck with a fenced-off back yard\r\n• Double glazing and insulation for year-round comfort\r\n\r\nAnd then there’s the location. Enjoy an abundance of lifestyle options right on your doorstep, with nearby golf courses, Gulf Harbour Marine Village, boat ramps and the stunning Shakespear Regional Park all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the close proximity to quality schools, preschools and colleges, making this an ideal place to put down roots.\r\n\r\nFirst time offered. Great location. Excellent lifestyle. Call us today!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
